            <common:generalComment xml:lang="en">Inventory for 1 MJ heat from wood chips, burned in a cogeneration unit with a capacity of 1MWth. The multioutput process "wood chips, burned in cogen 1MWth" delivers the coproducts "heat, at cogen 1MWth, wood chips, allocation exergy" and "electricity, at cogen 1MWth, wood chips, allocation exergy". The energy efficiency is 35% for electricity and 45% for heat. The exergy factor is 1 for ectricity and 0.170 for heat. This leads to the allocation factor of 0.84 for electricity an 0.16 for heat.</common:generalComment>
